            "text": "Depth Sensor — Capability Reference\n\nAll 4 depth sensor operators side by side.\n\n1. DepthSensorDAT — lists devices + capabilities\n2. DepthSensorTOP — depth/color/IR/player textures\n3. DepthSkeletonCHOP — joint tracking (Kinect only)\n4. DepthPointCloudSOP — 3D point cloud mesh\n\nSet the same Device Serial on all operators to\nshare one hardware connection. The DAT table\nshows which capabilities each sensor supports.",
